      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auburn%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s name honors Baron Johann de Kalb, a Bavarian-born major general who served in the Continental Army.",
